    "detailed_description": "<h1>Also recommended for you:</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/80f9d179358a7abac7863dd2ed0839b1.avif?t=1662477888\" /></div><br><br>The Alchemist Shop: An Apprentice's Life is a game that mixes <strong>Visual Novel</strong> and <strong>Solitaire</strong>. You play as Faih, a young alchemist that just managed to be hired by Arcani, the owner of the <strong>BEST Alchemist Shop</strong> of the continent. You will be in charge of the shop for 15 days and must deliver the best <strong>potions </strong>possible if you want to keep your job. Are you up to the task?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How To Play</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Listen to your master!</strong></h2><br>Arcani is here to guide you and make sure you do not get into trouble! I mean, in theory...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ab0b447eb8f52212e7e69e55d1ca4344.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ab0b447eb8f52212e7e69e55d1ca4344.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ab0b447eb8f52212e7e69e55d1ca4344.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solitaire</strong></h2><br>You have to manage a board full of cards using a solitaire-like mechanic. You can only move a card on top of another with a value higher than theirs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ac634285fa48daa63a4b8a435a7484b6.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ac634285fa48daa63a4b8a435a7484b6.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ac634285fa48daa63a4b8a435a7484b6.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create Potions</strong></h2><br>Find the right ingredients among the cards you have and place them on the slots at the middle of the table to create a potion!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1ed5c2d26779af767a2d6700f1e8b1c7.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1ed5c2d26779af767a2d6700f1e8b1c7.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1ed5c2d26779af767a2d6700f1e8b1c7.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to know the right recipe?</strong></h2><br>Make sure to choose the right potions to the case! If you're unsure, do not worry! Faih is an organized person, he keeps journal with all of them!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1dfa6b2ab0b1e2896fb370a2f6043d97.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1dfa6b2ab0b1e2896fb370a2f6043d97.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1dfa6b2ab0b1e2896fb370a2f6043d97.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time Limit</strong></h2><br>Time sure flies by when you're having a good time. Be aware of the time, you need to finish all recipes by the end of the day! Or else...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/eb6c48dcb993e46b10e6b3675f662f07.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/eb6c48dcb993e46b10e6b3675f662f07.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/eb6c48dcb993e46b10e6b3675f662f07.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features </strong></h2><br>- Enjoy this different approach to a <strong>Solitaire </strong>game! Challenge yourself to find the right <strong>ingredients </strong>to complete your <strong>orders</strong>!<br><br>- <strong>Game Story</strong>: Succeed in 14 different challenges and dive into the story of the young Alchemist apprentice! Be aware, your <strong>choices </strong>will shape your destiny!<br><br>- A beautiful and <strong>original soundtrack</strong> will make you feel as you're the alchemist apprentice yourself!<br><br>- Enjoy the company of<strong> Faih and Arcani</strong>, they are excited to spend some time with you!<br><br>- Challenge yourself on an exciting <strong> Arcade mode</strong>, after you beat the main story!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/80f9d179358a7abac7863dd2ed0839b1.avif?t=1662477888\" /></div><br><br>The Alchemist Shop: An Apprentice's Life is a game that mixes <strong>Visual Novel</strong> and <strong>Solitaire</strong>. You play as Faih, a young alchemist that just managed to be hired by Arcani, the owner of the <strong>BEST Alchemist Shop</strong> of the continent. You will be in charge of the shop for 15 days and must deliver the best <strong>potions </strong>possible if you want to keep your job. Are you up to the task?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How To Play</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Listen to your master!</strong></h2><br>Arcani is here to guide you and make sure you do not get into trouble! I mean, in theory...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ab0b447eb8f52212e7e69e55d1ca4344.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ab0b447eb8f52212e7e69e55d1ca4344.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ab0b447eb8f52212e7e69e55d1ca4344.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solitaire</strong></h2><br>You have to manage a board full of cards using a solitaire-like mechanic. You can only move a card on top of another with a value higher than theirs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ac634285fa48daa63a4b8a435a7484b6.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ac634285fa48daa63a4b8a435a7484b6.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/ac634285fa48daa63a4b8a435a7484b6.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create Potions</strong></h2><br>Find the right ingredients among the cards you have and place them on the slots at the middle of the table to create a potion!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1ed5c2d26779af767a2d6700f1e8b1c7.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1ed5c2d26779af767a2d6700f1e8b1c7.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1ed5c2d26779af767a2d6700f1e8b1c7.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to know the right recipe?</strong></h2><br>Make sure to choose the right potions to the case! If you're unsure, do not worry! Faih is an organized person, he keeps journal with all of them!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1dfa6b2ab0b1e2896fb370a2f6043d97.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1dfa6b2ab0b1e2896fb370a2f6043d97.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/1dfa6b2ab0b1e2896fb370a2f6043d97.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time Limit</strong></h2><br>Time sure flies by when you're having a good time. Be aware of the time, you need to finish all recipes by the end of the day! Or else...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/eb6c48dcb993e46b10e6b3675f662f07.poster.avif?t=1662477888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/eb6c48dcb993e46b10e6b3675f662f07.webm?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746700/extras/eb6c48dcb993e46b10e6b3675f662f07.mp4?t=1662477888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features </strong></h2><br>- Enjoy this different approach to a <strong>Solitaire </strong>game! Challenge yourself to find the right <strong>ingredients </strong>to complete your <strong>orders</strong>!<br><br>- <strong>Game Story</strong>: Succeed in 14 different challenges and dive into the story of the young Alchemist apprentice! Be aware, your <strong>choices </strong>will shape your destiny!<br><br>- A beautiful and <strong>original soundtrack</strong> will make you feel as you're the alchemist apprentice yourself!<br><br>- Enjoy the company of<strong> Faih and Arcani</strong>, they are excited to spend some time with you!<br><br>- Challenge yourself on an exciting <strong> Arcade mode</strong>, after you beat the main story!",
    "short_description": "Help Faih to deliver well brewed potions to your customers in the best of the alchemist shops! Dive into an innovative experience that mixes Visual Novel and Solitaire. Make your choices, manage your cards and try to impress your master. Are you up to the task?",
